name: transparent-support-units
displayName: Transparent Support Units
author: Aewsomn
description: "Turns Mono, Poly, Mega, Quad, and Oct into mostly-transparent 'ghosts' with a visible team-colored outline, instead of hiding them completely. Toggle it from Settings > Transparent Support Units, or press F9 (rebindable in Settings > Controls) to flip it on/off instantly, no restart needed."
version: 2.0
minGameVersion: 159
hidden: true
